cambiar('idioma_js',
        '    prof_manejo: "Driving",\n    cmp_unidad_gps: "It has GPS. During your service —from the trip to the point until your end check-in— it confirms your check-ins and counts the kilometers. Outside the service nobody looks at where it is; only its panic button counts.",\n    cmp_voy_en_camino_gps: "If you are in the vehicle, the control room already sees it through its GPS.",\n  },\n\n  pt: {\n',
        '    prof_manejo: "Driving",\n    cmp_unidad_gps: "It has GPS. During your service —from the trip to the point until your end check-in— it confirms your check-ins and counts the kilometers. Outside the service nobody looks at where it is; only its panic button counts.",\n    cmp_voy_en_camino_gps: "If you are in the vehicle, the control room already sees it through its GPS.",\n\n    /* La pantalla de Odoo (seccion 64). */\n    odo_sub: "What Centauro reads from Odoo: the security staff and the fleet. The first reading of each is done here, after looking at the trial run; from then on each one is read automatically every hour. Nothing here writes to Odoo.",\n    odo_conectado: "Connected to {sitio}.",\n    odo_sin_conexion: "This server doesn\'t have the Odoo key, and without it nothing can be read. It goes in the server\'s .env and IT puts it there.",\n    odo_personal: "Security staff",\n    odo_flota: "Fleet and workshop",\n    odo_nunca: "Not read yet. The hourly reading waits until someone does the first one here, after looking at the trial run.",\n    odo_ultima_a_mano: "Last manual reading: {cuando}, by {quien}.",\n    odo_sola: "The hourly reading is running: the last one was {hace}.",\n    odo_sola_aun_no: "The hourly reading can run now; its first turn hasn\'t come yet.",\n    odo_cuando: "{fecha} at {hora}",\n    odo_hace_min: "{n} min ago",\n    odo_hace_h: "{n} h ago",\n    odo_hace_d: "{n} days ago",\n    odo_ensayo: "Trial run",\n    odo_aplicar: "Apply",\n    odo_aplicar_cifras: "Apply: new {altas} · changes {cambios} · removals {bajas}",\n    odo_primero_ensayo: "Trial run first: it says what it would do without saving anything.",\n    odo_leyendo: "Reading Odoo…",\n    odo_guardando: "Saving…",\n    odo_ensayo_de: "Trial run at {hora}: nothing was saved",\n    odo_aplicado_de: "Applied at {hora}",\n    odo_confirmar_personal: "New: {altas}, with their app access. Brought up to date: {cambios} (linked for the first time: {vinculadas}). Removals: {bajas}. Pending items are left alone. Applying reads Odoo again: if someone changed it since the trial run, what is there at that moment is saved.",\n    odo_confirmar_flota: "New: {altas}. Brought up to date: {cambios} (linked for the first time: {vinculadas}). Removals: {bajas}. And the workshop is brought up to date. Pending items are left alone. Applying reads Odoo again: if someone changed it since the trial run, what is there at that moment is saved.",\n    odo_si_aplicar: "Yes, apply",\n    odo_aplicado: "Done: it was saved.",\n    odo_altas: "New",\n    odo_altas_personal_pie: "come in with their app access",\n    odo_altas_flota_pie: "vehicles Centauro didn\'t have",\n    odo_cambios: "Changes",\n    odo_cambios_pie: "linked for the first time: {v}",\n    odo_bajas: "Removals",\n    odo_bajas_personal_pie: "their access is closed",\n    odo_bajas_flota_pie: "no longer offered",\n    odo_pendientes: "Pending",\n    odo_pendientes_pie: "left alone until fixed in Odoo",\n    odo_leidos_personal: "Security staff in Odoo: {n} · unchanged: {s}",\n    odo_leidos_flota: "Executive Protection vehicles in Odoo: {n} · unchanged: {s}",\n    odo_l_pendientes: "Pending: what needs fixing in Odoo",\n    odo_l_altas: "New",\n    odo_l_vinculadas: "Linked: they were already in Centauro",\n    odo_l_cambios: "Changes",\n    odo_l_bajas: "Removals",\n    odo_l_celular: "Mobile number in Odoo that isn\'t a number",\n    odo_celular_pie: "They come in without a mobile number, and the one Centauro already had stays.",\n    odo_accesos_cerrados: "Logins closed because they no longer owe expenses: {n}",\n    odo_fotos: "Photos: {r} real ones and {s} with initials only.",\n    odo_fotos_guardadas: "Photos: {r} real ones ({g} saved) and {s} with initials only.",\n    odo_taller: "Workshop: new {nuevas} · changes {cambios} · deleted {borradas} · unchanged {sin}",\n    odo_taller_error: "The workshop couldn\'t be read: {e}",\n    odo_no_odoo: "Odoo No. {n}",\n    odo_baja_dias: "assigned days ahead: {n}",\n    odo_b_archivado: "archived in Odoo",\n    odo_b_archivada: "archived in Odoo",\n    odo_b_ya_no_esta: "no longer in Odoo",\n    odo_b_se_cierra: "their access is closed",\n    odo_b_viaticos: "their access stays open until they settle their expenses",\n    odo_f_sin_plaza: "No location",\n    odo_f_plaza_no_existe: "The location «{x}» doesn\'t exist in Centauro",\n    odo_f_sin_correo: "No personal email",\n    odo_f_correo_mal: "Badly written email",\n    odo_f_correo_dedo: "Email with a typo",\n    odo_f_correo_repetido: "Email repeated in Odoo",\n    odo_f_correo_otro_acceso: "Their email already belongs to another login in Centauro",\n    odo_f_correo_otra: "Their email already belongs to someone else in Centauro",\n    odo_f_correo_nuevo_otra: "Their new email already belongs to someone else in Centauro",\n    odo_f_reactivar_persona: "Active in Odoo but terminated in Centauro: reactivate by hand",\n    odo_f_sin_puesto: "No longer has a security position in Odoo",\n    odo_f_sin_placa: "No plate",\n    odo_f_placa_repetida: "Plate repeated in Odoo",\n    odo_f_sin_categoria: "No category",\n    odo_f_categoria_no_existe: "The category «{x}» doesn\'t exist in Centauro",\n    odo_f_placa_otra: "Its plate already belongs to another vehicle in Centauro",\n    odo_f_placa_nueva_otra: "Its new plate already belongs to another vehicle in Centauro",\n    odo_f_reactivar_unidad: "Active in Odoo but removed in Centauro: reactivate by hand",\n    odo_f_no_es_pe: "No longer Executive Protection in Odoo",\n    odo_f_revisar: "Check in Odoo",\n    odo_f_taller_sin_entrada: "Workshop entry without an entry date",\n    odo_f_taller_al_reves: "Workshop entry with the exit before the entry",\n    odo_f_taller_sin_salida: "Workshop job finished without an exit date: the entry day was used",\n    odo_q_nombre: "name",\n    odo_q_plaza: "location",\n    odo_q_celular: "mobile",\n    odo_q_referencia: "reference",\n    odo_q_ingreso: "start date",\n    odo_q_correo: "email",\n    odo_q_placa: "plate",\n    odo_q_categoria: "category",\n    odo_q_modelo: "make and model",\n    odo_q_color: "color",\n    odo_q_anio: "year",\n    odo_historial: "Latest readings",\n    odo_sin_lecturas: "No readings yet.",\n    odo_h_cuando: "When",\n    odo_h_que: "What",\n    odo_h_como: "How",\n    odo_h_quien: "Who",\n    odo_t_personal: "Staff",\n    odo_t_flota: "Fleet",\n    odo_a_mano: "by hand",\n    odo_sola_h: "automatic, hourly",\n    ay_odo_personal_para: "Brings the security staff from Odoo —position «Personal de Seguridad» or «Security Driver»— with their location, mobile, personal email, reference and photo. It adds whoever is missing, with their app access; changes for each person what changed in Odoo; and removes whoever was archived there.",\n    ay_odo_personal_cuando: "Right here: if the Odoo key expires —it lasts three months at most— the trial run says so, and the hourly reading stops showing up under «Latest readings». And whoever doesn\'t come in because of something in Odoo shows up under Pending, with what is missing and their Odoo No.",\n    ay_odo_personal_numero: "Everything comes from reading Odoo at that moment. New: security staff Centauro doesn\'t have. Changes: the ones it has whose Odoo record says something else. Removals: the ones Centauro keeps that are no longer active in Odoo.",\n    ay_odo_flota_para: "Brings from Odoo the vehicles tagged «PROTECCIÓN EJECUTIVA» or «pe», with their plate, category and location, and the days each one spends in the workshop, so it isn\'t offered on those days. The plate is what links each vehicle to its GPS.",\n    ay_odo_flota_cuando: "Right here: if the key expires, the trial run says so and the hourly reading stops showing up below. A vehicle without a plate, or with a category or location Centauro doesn\'t have, shows up under Pending with its Odoo No. until it is fixed there.",\n    ay_odo_flota_numero: "Everything comes from reading Odoo at that moment. New: Executive Protection vehicles Centauro doesn\'t have. Removals: the ones Centauro keeps that were archived in Odoo or are no longer Executive Protection.",\n    ay_odo_pendientes_para: "What doesn\'t get into Centauro until it is fixed in Odoo, grouped by what is missing and with each one\'s Odoo No. to find it there. It is HR\'s work list, or that of whoever manages the fleet in Odoo.",\n    ay_odo_pendientes_cuando: "On every trial run and on every hourly reading. Pending items aren\'t touched or deleted: they stay out. As soon as they are fixed in Odoo, the next reading picks them up by itself; nothing is entered here.",\n    ay_odo_pendientes_numero: "The total counts each one once, even if two things are missing; in the list they show up in each group of what is missing. For the fleet, workshop entries with dates that don\'t add up also count.",\n    ay_odo_historial_para: "Every time Centauro read Odoo —by hand from here or automatically every hour—, who did it and what came out: new, changes, removals and pending.",\n    ay_odo_historial_cuando: "If the hourly one stops showing up, something stopped it. It is almost always the Odoo key, which expires after three months at most: a new one has to be created in Odoo and IT has to put it on the server.",\n    ay_odo_historial_numero: "These are the counts each reading left when it was saved. Hourly readings with nothing new also leave their row, so you can see they ran.",\n  },\n\n  pt: {\n')

